# Normalise line endings so a checkout on Windows does not immediately look
# dirty. `core.autocrlf=true` converts LF to CRLF in the working tree, but with
# no .gitattributes git had no record of the canonical form — so
# `src/routeTree.gen.ts` reported as modified after every checkout and blocked
# `git pull` with "your local changes would be overwritten", despite
# `git diff --numstat` being empty.
#
# `text=auto eol=lf` stores everything with LF and checks it out with LF, which
# matches what prettier writes and what the repo already contains.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
